You have not taken the Magic Prison yet? I understand your concern for the surface. The Black Specters are spreading chaos across the continent. But Commander Derik has already begun an operation to take the people to safe places.

Together with Diana, Lirie, Dorian, Pythia and the Elemental Priestesses, I performed the ritual, joining the energy of the Quintessences, the Quintessence Soul Stones and the Ideta Stones to create the Jewel of Life.

We have to work together. The Jewel of Life will draw the Black Specters. That will be our chance to cast the specter out of Yagditha's body and defeat them both.

Come on, defeat Yagditha.
